WEBVTT

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:02.261
Now I get my hair cut
about half as often as I used to,

00:03:02.303 --> 00:03:04.388
but it costs 10 times as much.

00:03:04.388 --> 00:03:06.599
(Laughter)

00:03:06.599 --> 00:03:08.976
So I can go on vacation
or I can get my hair cut,

00:03:08.976 --> 00:03:10.353
I cannot do both.

00:03:10.353 --> 00:03:12.396
(Laughter)

00:03:12.438 --> 00:03:15.107
I keep bumping into gender differences

00:03:15.149 --> 00:03:16.692
everywhere I go,

00:03:16.692 --> 00:03:18.361
sometimes literally.

00:03:18.694 --> 00:03:21.572
I’m walking down the hallway,
and I just bump into it.

00:03:21.614 --> 00:03:23.366
There’s nothing in the way,

00:03:23.366 --> 00:03:24.617
and I just bump into it.

00:03:24.659 --> 00:03:25.993
I think, what's that about?

00:03:26.035 --> 00:03:30.081
And I know it's going to leave a bruise
because now that my skin is thinner,